# GenAI classification image payloads are local-only by default.
# Keep the directory skeleton and documentation in git; keep media/manifests out
# until we intentionally add de-identified sample fixtures.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!*/
!.gitkeep
!manifests/combined_labels.portable.jsonl
!sample/**/*.png
!sample/**/*.jpg
!sample/**/*.jpeg
!sample/**/*.JPEG
!sample/**/*.webp
!sample/**/*.gif
